  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "エネルギーの　つまった　おおきい　アメ。\nレベル３０　いじょうの　ポケモンの\nぼうぎょを　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "에너지가 가득한 큰 사탕.\n레벨 30 이상인 포켓몬의\n방어를 올린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "充滿能量的大糖果。\n能提高等級在30以上的\n寶可夢的防禦。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un gros bonbon plein d’énergie.\nIl augmente la Défense d’un Pokémon de niveau 30\nou supérieur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein großes Bonbon, das voller Energie steckt.\nErhöht dauerhaft die Verteidigung eines Pokémon ab\nLevel 30.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Caramelo energético grande que aumenta la Defensa\nde un Pokémon de Nv. 30 o superior.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una caramella piena zeppa di energia.\nAumenta la Difesa di un Pokémon di livello 30\no superiore.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A big candy that is packed with energy. When given to\na Pokémon at Lv. 30 or higher, it will increase\nthat Pokémon’s Defense stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "エネルギーの　つまった　大きい　アメ。\nレベル３０　以上の　ポケモンの\nぼうぎょを　上げる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
